    <string name="about_text">GT Unblock is a standalone app that bypasses DPI blocking on Android. It works like a VPN but without a server: traffic stays on the device, only the way packets are sent changes. An alternative to ByeByeDPI with auto tuning, diagnostics and a live Aqua design.</string>
    <string name="about_dev">Developer: GREENTUNE</string>
